WEBVTT

L01
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:21.570
<v Proog>At the left we can see... At the right we can see the... the head-snarlers. Everything is safe. Perfectly safe.

L02
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.370
<v Proog>Emo? Emo!

L03
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.210
<v Proog>Watch out!

L04
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.150
<v Proog>Are you hurt?

L05
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.040
<v Emo>I don't think so. You?

L06
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.280
<v Proog>I'm OK.

L07
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.280
<v Proog>Get up. Emo, it's not safe here.

L08
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.600
<v Proog>Let's go.

L09
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.200
<v Emo>What's next?

L10
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.600
<v Proog>You'll see. ... You'll see.

L11
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.220
<v Proog>Emo, this way.

L12
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.100
<v Proog>Follow me!

L13
00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.340
<v Proog>(indistinct mutter as he leaps on)

L14
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:11.790
<v Proog>Hurry, Emo!

L15
00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.970
<v Proog>Listen, listen!

L16
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.780
<v Proog>Listen... listen.

L17
00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:49.410
<v Proog>You're not paying attention!

L18
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.390
<v Emo>I... I just want to answer the phone...

L19
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.770
<v Proog>Emo, look. I mean, listen.

L20
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:00.960
<v Proog>You have to learn to listen.

L21
00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.270
<v Proog>This is not some game.

L22
00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.050
<v Proog>You... I mean, we... we could easily die out here.

L23
00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.590
<v Proog>Listen. Listen to the sounds of the machine.

L24
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.740
<v Proog>Listen to your breathing.

L25
00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.320
<v Emo>Well, don't you ever get tired of this?

L26
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.800
<v Proog>Tired?

L27
00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.800
<v Proog>Emo, the machine is like... like clockwork.

L28
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.070
<v Proog>One move out of place... and you're ground to a pulp.

L29
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.160
<v Proog>Pulp, Emo! Is that what you want? Pulp?

L30
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.280
<v Proog>Emo, your goal in life...

L31
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.800
<v Proog>Pulp!

L32
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.950
<v Proog>Emo, close your eyes.

L33
00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:45.300
<v Proog>Now!

L34
00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.340
<v Proog>What do you see at your left side, Emo?

L35
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:02.800
<v Emo>Well... nothing.

L36
00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:05.700
<v Proog>Really?

L37
00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.160
<v Emo>No, nothing at all.

L38
00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.400
<v Proog>Really.

L39
00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.400
<v Proog>And at your right?

L40
00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.500
<v Proog>What do you see at your right side, Emo?

L41
00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.230
<v Emo>The same, Proog. Exactly the same. Nothing!

L42
00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.910
<v Emo>Listen, Proog. Do you hear that? Can we go here?

L43
00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.000
<v Proog>There?

L44
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:46.600
<v Emo>Yeah.

L45
00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.870
<v Proog>It isn't safe, Emo.

L46
00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:49.700
<v Emo>But...

L47
00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.620
<v Proog>Trust me, it's not.

L48
00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.030
<v Emo>Well, maybe I could...

L49
00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.400
<v Proog>No.

L50
00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:57.900
<v Emo>But...

L51
00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:58.800
<v Proog>No!

L52
00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.550
<v Proog>Any further questions, Emo?

L53
00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.100
<v Emo>No.

L54
00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.520
<v Proog>Emo.

L55
00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.600
<v Emo>Yeah?

L56
00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:16.150
<v Proog>Emo, why... Emo, why... why can't you see the beauty of this place?

L57
00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.150
<v Proog>The way it works... how perfect it is.

L58
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:28.010
<v Emo>No, Proog, I don't see. I don't see because there's nothing there.

L59
00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.400
<v Emo>And why should I trust my life to something that isn't there?

L60
00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.640
<v Emo>Well, can you tell me that? Proog, answer me!

L61
00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:45.820
<v Emo>Proog... you're a sick man.

L62
00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.200
<v Emo>Stay away from me.

L63
00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.920
<v Proog>No, Emo, it's a trap!

L64
00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:56.600
<v Emo>It's a trap?

L65
00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.810
<v Emo>At the left side you can see... the Hanging Gardens of Babylon!

L66
00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.040
<v Emo>How's that for a trap?

L67
00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:06.520
<v Proog>No, Emo.

L68
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.460
<v Emo>On the right side you can see...

L69
00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.600
<v Emo>Well, guess what?

L70
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.200
<v Emo>The Colossus of Rhodes!

L71
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.300
<v Proog>No!

L72
00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.610
<v Emo>The Colossus of Rhodes!

L73
00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.480
<v Emo>And it is here just for you, Proog.

L74
00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.000
<v Emo>Just for you.

L75
00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:54.450
<v Proog>It is there... I'm telling you, Emo... it is... it is...
